---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Engineering leader in Tokyo. Writing on privacy, how teams learn, and building in two languages.
---

<div class="col noted">
  <p class="lede">
    I <span class="revise"><del>manage</del><ins>build</ins></span> engineering organisations in
    Tokyo — currently at a frontier AI research lab, before that Google Maps, Mercari, and a
    hardware company in California. Trained as a cognitive scientist. Taught for ten years before
    writing a line of production code. I write here about privacy, about how teams learn, and
    occasionally in Japanese.
  </p>
  <span class="mnote">
    {# The arrow is the most hand-made thing on the page, so it is the one that
       should look least settled — three passes of the same pencil. #}
    <svg class="mark" width="38" height="20" viewBox="0 0 38 20" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <path id="mnote-arrow" d="M36 4 C 26 2, 12 7, 3 15 M3 15 l 8 -1 M3 15 l 1 -7"
              fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </defs>
      <g class="boil">
        {%- for f in ["pen","pen2","pen3"] %}
        <g><use href="#mnote-arrow" filter="url(#{{ f }})"/></g>
        {%- endfor %}
      </g>
    </svg>
    third draft. still one clause too long
  </span>
</div>

<section class="col">
  <ul class="index">
    <h2 class="section-head">
      {# 麻の葉 (asanoha) — one hemp-leaf unit: a hexagon and its three
         diagonals. Small enough to read as a mark, not a pattern. #}
      <svg class="motif-asanoha" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 26 26" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <g id="asanoha-unit" fill="none" stroke="#4a7098" stroke-width="1.1">
            <path d="M13 2 L21.5 7 L21.5 19 L13 24 L4.5 19 L4.5 7 Z"/>
            <path d="M13 2 L13 24 M4.5 7 L21.5 19 M21.5 7 L4.5 19"/>
          </g>
        </defs>
        <g class="boil" opacity=".8" style="mix-blend-mode:var(--wash-blend)">
          {%- for f in ["wet-line","wet-line2","wet-line3"] %}
          <g><use href="#asanoha-unit" filter="url(#{{ f }})"/></g>
          {%- endfor %}
        </g>
      </svg>
      Writing
    </h2>
    {%- for post in collections.writing %}
    <li>
      <a class="piece" href="{{ post.url | rel }}">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | monthYear }}</time>
        <div>
          <h3>{% dab post.fileSlug, (post.data.wash.palette if post.data.wash else "indigo"), 22 %}{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
